        <mxCell id="c18" value="&lt;font color=&quot;#B03A2E&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Tidy data principles violated:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. Month is stored in column headers, not in its own column.&lt;br&gt;2. Each row contains three observations (three months), not one.&lt;br&gt;This layout prevents direct use in PivotTables, SQL GROUP BY queries, or Power BI data models." style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FDEDEC;strokeColor=#B03A2E;strokeWidth=1;fontColor=#2C3E50;fontSize=13;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="510" y="26" width="350" height="124" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
